      <span class="eyebrow">Our programmes</span>
      <h1>Safety is not the finish line.</h1>
      <div class="lede"><p>A woman who is safe but has no income, no counsel and no legal standing has been moved from one kind of trap to another. Our programmes are built as a continuum — most women move through several, at their own pace, over months or years.</p></div>
