          <ul class="checklist">
                        <li>[24/7 — or specify hours] confidential helpline</li>
                        <li>Personalised safety planning</li>
                        <li>Referral to vetted emergency shelter partners</li>
                        <li>Accompaniment to medical care and forensic examination</li>
